          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>GenerateOrdersByReorderPoint</name>
            <id>854</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>By reorder point</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>بر اساس نقطه سفارش</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>По точке заказа</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Yeniden sipariş noktasında</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Theo điểm đặt hàng</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>By reorder point</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>By reorder point</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>Object.GenerateOrdersByReorderPoint</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
            <toolTip>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Orders are generated on any day when the reorder point is triggered, i.e. when the balance is reduced to the minimum inventory or when the order shipment date is approaching.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>سفارش‌ها در هر روزی که نقطه سفارش فعال شود ایجاد می‌شوند، یعنی وقتی مانده به حداقل موجودی کاهش یابد یا تاریخ ارسال سفارش نزدیک شود.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Заказы формируются в любой день, при наступлении точки заказа. Точка заказа для товара наступает, когда остаток снижается до минимального запаса, а также когда приближается дата отгрузки потребности по заказу (на срок исполнения заказа).</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Siparişler, sipariş noktasına ulaşılan herhangi bir gün oluşturulur. Ürün için sipariş noktası; bakiye miktarı minimum seviyeye düştüğünde veya sipariş gereksiniminin tedarik tarihi yaklaştığında (temin süresi dikkate alınarak) oluşur.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Orders are generated on any day when the reorder point is triggered, i.e. when the balance is reduced to the minimum inventory or when the order shipment date is approaching.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Orders are generated on any day when the reorder point is triggered, i.e. when the balance is reduced to the minimum inventory or when the order shipment date is approaching.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Orders are generated on any day when the reorder point is triggered, i.e. when the balance is reduced to the minimum inventory or when the order shipment date is approaching.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>GenerateOrdersByReorderPointOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>GenerateOrdersByReorderPointExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>856</id>
