        <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
          <name>TheGroupOnSchedule</name>
          <id>1032</id>
          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>GenerateOrdersOnSchedule</name>
            <id>857</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>On delivery schedule</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>طبق برنامه تحویل</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>По расписанию поставок</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Tedarik takvimine göre</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>On delivery schedule</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>On delivery schedule</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>On delivery schedule</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>Object.GenerateOrdersOnSchedule</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
            <toolTip>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Orders are generated with order fulfillment period relative to the fixed delivery date. Delivery dates form a delivery schedule, which can be set by rules or fixed in the delivery schedule.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>سفارش‌ها با مدت اجرای سفارش نسبت به تاریخ تحویل ثابت ایجاد می‌شوند. تاریخ‌های تحویل یک برنامه تحویل را تشکیل می‌دهند که می‌تواند با قواعد تعیین یا در برنامه تحویل ثابت شود.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Заказы формируются с упреждением на срок исполнения заказа относительно фиксированной даты поставки. Даты поставки образуют расписание поставок, которое можно задать правилами, либо зафиксировать в графике поставок.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Siparişler, sabit bir tedarik tarihine göre siparişin teslim süresi kadar önceden oluşturulur. Tedarik tarihleri; kurallarla belirlenebilen veya tedarik çizelgesinde sabitlenebilen bir tedarik takvimi oluşturur.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Orders are generated with order fulfillment period relative to the fixed delivery date. Delivery dates form a delivery schedule, which can be set by rules or fixed in the delivery schedule.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Orders are generated with order fulfillment period relative to the fixed delivery date. Delivery dates form a delivery schedule, which can be set by rules or fixed in the delivery schedule.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Orders are generated with order fulfillment period relative to the fixed delivery date. Delivery dates form a delivery schedule, which can be set by rules or fixed in the delivery schedule.</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>GenerateOrdersOnScheduleOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>GenerateOrdersOnScheduleExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>859</id>
              <type>Label</type>
              <width>48</width>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
